# Repository file layout

One repository **type** = one file on each side.

```text
backend/internal/<module>/repository/<name>.go
backend/internal/<module>/infrastructure/postgres/<name>_repo.go
```

Identity: `user_repo.go`, `identity_repo.go`, `credential_repo.go`, `session_repo.go`, `role_repo.go`.

Do **not** add a new adapter into `repos.go` or merge unrelated SQL into an existing `*_repo.go`.

Shared `nullStr` / scan helpers: `infrastructure/postgres/helpers.go` only.

Full text: `docs/architecture/backend-feature-playbook.md` (Repository) and `docs/architecture/coding-style.md` (Repository files).
